## Step 2 — the router at home

Set up **port forwarding**: TCP **443** from outside → `{{LAN_IP}}`, port **443** (that is this
computer's address in the home network). Do not forward port 80 — it is not needed, even if your
provider blocks it. It is also worth giving the computer a fixed address in the router (a "DHCP
reservation") so that `{{LAN_IP}}` does not change.

{{HOME_FIREWALL_EN}}

